 "about": "The crew parts' far copies (made by ~/pw/space-math/rigs/station-life-2/far/far-make.cjs with meshoptimizer 1.3.0): for each part file, its skinned meshes in the order met, their points and triangles as made, and the triangles the far copy keeps (<file stem>.bin, Uint16, one mesh after another). check: a sum over the part's own triangle list, so a part re-made since is noticed (kit/crew.js then draws it whole and says so).",
